description: |
  Searches for indicators within the tenant's indicator database based on arguments provided by the user. This command can be used to retrieve indicators such as IPs, domains, URLs, file hashes, and emails, and supports filtering and result enrichment options.
display: Cortex - List Indicators
isdetailsoverridden: false
